      "decision": "A cloned prototype keeps colours that have no semantic token in app/prototypes/<slug>/brand.ts and nowhere else; token-lint and atlas-verify exempt only that file and list it. Shared prototype chrome (_shared/, e.g. PhoneFrame) uses semantic tokens only. No inline token-lint suppressions in app/.",
      "date": "2026-09-13"
    }
